    "text": "arkansasradio.com\nwebsite\nBatesville\nLead. With. Purpose. Leadership Development Event in Batesville was a Success\nBy News Staff,\n10 hours agoFirst Community Bank recently hosted Lead. With. Purpose., a leadership development event held on Friday, October 3, at the University of Arkansas Community College at Batesville (UACCB) in Independence Hall. Presented by First Community Bank, the event was created to inspire and equip leaders to grow with intention—both professionally and personally—demonstrating the bank’s continued commitment to investing in the communities it serves.",
